   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "dark_eldar"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include at least 2 different Troops choices.\n- Your army must include at least 2 different HQ choices.\n- Your army must include a Webway Gate.\n\nBenefits\n\n- Do not roll for Night Fighting. Night fighting is automatically in effect for this battle even if Night Fighting is not part of your Battle Packs rules. You may choose if it is Dawn or Dusk.\n- Webway Gates cost 0pts.\n- Each of your HQ units may generate a Warlord trait as if they were your Warlord. All of your HQ units count as your Warlord.",
