  {
   "id": "codex/dark_eldar/rites_of_war/kabal_of_the_black_heart",
   "name": "Kabal of the Black Heart",
   "page": 17,
   "url": "https://longwarindex.app/rites_of_war/kabal_of_the_black_heart/",
   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "dark_eldar"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army may not include units with the Coven Keyword.\n- If Asdrubael Vect on Dias of Destruction is in your army, he must be your Warlord.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Archon.\n\nBenefits\n\n- Archon units become Limited: 3 per Detachment instead of Limited: 1 Per detachment.\n- Kabalite units in your army may include an additional 15 Kabalite models instead of 5 (max 20 models per unit).\n- You gain access to Asdrubael Vect on Dias of Destruction.",
